"fig2","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_015_s9","report_id":"v3feat_015","text":"As shown in Figure 2(a), MobileNet reaches 62.2% test accuracy on Fashion-MNIST.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_015_s10","report_id":"v3feat_015","text":"MobileNet reaches 70.5% test accuracy on MNIST.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_015_s11","report_id":"v3feat_015","text":"MobileNet achieves 67.1% test accuracy on CIFAR-10.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_015_s12","report_id":"v3feat_015","text":"At epoch 10, the loss of BERT-base is 1.059 (Figure 2).","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_015_s13","report_id":"v3feat_015","text":"At epoch 40, the loss of ViT-S is 0.695.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_015_s14","report_id":"v3feat_015","text":"ViT-S has a loss of 0.598 at epoch 60.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_015_s15","report_id":"v3feat_015","text":"The loss of ViT-S reaches its highest value of 1.653 at epoch 10.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_015_s16","report_id":"v3feat_015","text":"Figure 3 shows the results of this experiment.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_015_s17","report_id":"v3feat_015","text":"(%) Accuracy","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_015_s18","report_id":"v3feat_015","text":"Dataset","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_015_s19","report_id":"v3feat_015","text":"On Fashion-MNIST, ViT-S obtains a accuracy of 93.6%.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_015_s20","report_id":"v3feat_015","text":"GRU scores 14.0 points higher on CIFAR-10 than on SST-2.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_015_s21","report_id":"v3feat_015","text":"Figure 4 shows the results of this experiment.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_015_s22","report_id":"v3feat_015","text":"(%) Accuracy","page":2,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_015_s23","report_id":"v3feat_015","text":"As shown in Figure 1, Ours outperforms GRU by 12.1 percentage points on IMDB.","page":2,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_015_s24","report_id":"v3feat_015","text":"As shown in Figure 4, GRU reaches 67.8% accuracy on CIFAR-10.","page":2,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_015_s25","report_id":"v3feat_015","text":"Overall, the results are in line with what we expected from the literature.","page":2,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4","figure_id":null}]}